	(text "System-5 IO panel card, Rev A (2026): the front panel on the 36-pin bus (docs/manual/bus.md, the 36-pin extension). Design notes: ../DESIGN.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c1aee259-e648-5348-9572-3cb36e1981b1"))
	(text "Ports on jumpers (U1 74HCT138 on N0-N2; JP1 IN, JP2 OUT, set to 4): OUT latches the byte in U2 (74HCT374, on TPB's fall) for eight LEDs (RN2) and two TIL311s; INP reads the eight toggles SW1-SW8 through U3 (74HCT244)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c09e8b9c-906b-58fc-b682-4fda5599f545"))
	(text "INPUT (SW9, debounced) on a jumper-picked EF line (JP3, set to -EF1). ELF-style RUN/RESET (SW10, -RESET) and LOAD (SW11, -PAUSE) toggles; in LOAD mode each INPUT press is one DMA IN (U10: REQ, ACK) with the switches as the data. DS12885 clock (U13) on ports set by JP4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02f75625-fb91-5dd0-9dc7-940fa72d2728"))
	(text "The bus address on four TIL311s (U14-U17): U18 latches the high byte at TPA, U19 the low byte at TPB (74HCT573). Q LED push-pull (U5B). TIL311 pinout and footprint as on Ken's YACC1 IO card." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "769a6a71-0535-5e19-bbd4-189a6d924a31"))
	(text "Serial port (2026-11-20): U20 16C550 with X1 1.8432 MHz, U21 MAX232, J2 DE-9 (JP6 swaps pins 2 and 3), on the RTC's port pair: U22 holds the byte written to the address port, bit 7 = 1 the UART (80-87), 0 the DS12885. -RD from U11B; INTR to -INT through JP7." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0930514a-726b-5f98-860e-262c97878a9e"))
	(text "Generated by gen/make_schematic.py from gen/netlist.py." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f2881594-2c10-5b67-80ae-c5c82d397261"))
